  "description": "Domain model and contracts for composing PDF documents: the immutable MergePlan aggregate, page selection value objects, document metadata and the merging/inspection ports. Contains no third-party dependencies and performs no I/O.",
  "iconFile": "Logo-256.png",
  "id": "SharpCorePDF.Domain",
